---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/tasks-ai-evening-log-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/tasks-ai-evening-log-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Four fixes and two releases in the 74 minutes after the first commit"
  caption="The theme repo's git log for its first evening, 11 commits. Squares are the automated release commits."
>
  Timeline of one evening's 11 commits. The first commit lands at 9:24 PM. Four fixes follow at 9:41, 9:45, 9:48 and
  9:55 PM. Automated release commits land at 9:43 and 10:22 PM. Four documentation and showcase-site changes land at
  10:07, 10:21, 10:25 and 10:38 PM.
</Chart>
